 so far as  um admiral sir tony radkin said today  the chief of uh  the chief of defense staff and uk  military the russians have lost  strategically they're they're growing  the eu and they're growing nato and  they're bringing greater resolve  together tactically if they can get the  donbass region putin will see that as  some form of success however the resolve  we got out of the european leaders  visits yesterday saying that they didn't  see russia's ability to hold any  ukrainian territory as being key and i  think  president zielinski will have  convinced them of that that's that's the  key bit here significant that's very  significant indeed it does feel  significant thank you so much for coming  on and and telling us you know a bit of  what is really going on in ukraine all  important stories so thank you so much
 

